OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry, bright day with
OL,6,Fplenty of sunny spells. Sunshine will
OL,7,Fturn a little hazy at times through
OL,8,Fthe afternoon. Winds will be a light
OL,9,Fwesterly.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA dry evening with some
OL,12,Fsunshine to end the day. Remaining dry
OL,13,Fovernight and with clear skies
OL,14,Fdeveloping and light winds, it will
OL,15,Fbecome chilly in places.
OL,16,
OL,17,CTuesday:FA mainly dry and bright day
OL,18,Fwith variable cloud and some hazy
OL,19,Fsunny spells. Light winds and turning
OL,20,Fa little warmer.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
